<view class="page set-page">
  <!-- 行情刷新 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="set-title"><text>🔄 行情更新</text></view>
    <view class="set-note">
      <text>最近更新：{{lastUpdatedText}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-small btn-primary" disabled="{{syncing}}" onClick="manualUpdate">
        <text>{{syncing ? '刷新中…' : '立即更新'}}</text>
      </button>
    </view>
    <view class="field-label"><text>自动刷新间隔</text></view>
    <view class="type-row">
      <view
        class="type-chip {{refreshSec === item.value ? 'type-chip-on' : ''}}"
        a:for="{{refreshOptions}}" a:key="value"
        data-value="{{item.value}}" onTap="onRefreshPick">
        <text>{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="set-note">
      <text>自动刷新仅在本页停留期间生效，切换页面即暂停，省电省流量。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 数据库总览 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="set-title"><text>📊 数据库</text></view>
    <view class="set-stats" a:if="{{info}}">
      <view class="stat-cell">
        <text class="stat-value">{{info.fundCount}}</text>
        <text class="stat-label">基金库</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stat-cell">
        <text class="stat-value">{{info.etfCount}}</text>
        <text class="stat-label">ETF</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stat-cell">
        <text class="stat-value">{{info.indexCount}}</text>
        <text class="stat-label">指数</text>
      </view>
      <view class="stat-cell">
        <text class="stat-value">{{info.navCount}}</text>
        <text class="stat-label">净值缓存</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn-row">
      <button class="btn btn-small btn-primary" disabled="{{syncing}}" onClick="syncLibrary">
        <text>{{syncing ? '同步中…' : '同步全量基金'}}</text>
      </button>
      <button class="btn btn-small" onClick="loadAll"><text>刷新统计</text></button>
      <button class="btn btn-small btn-danger" onClick="clearFundLib"><text>清空基金库</text></button>
    </view>
    <view class="set-note" a:if="{{syncProgress}}"><text>{{syncProgress}}</text></view>
    <view class="set-note">
      <text>同步从东方财富拉取全部在售基金（约 2 万只、103 页）与最新净值，约需 2-3 分钟，20 小时内不重复同步。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 基金基础库检索 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="set-title"><text>🔍 基金基础库</text></view>
    <view class="toolbar">
      <input
        class="input set-search"
        placeholder="搜索代码 / 名称 / 拼音"
        value="{{fundQuery}}"
        onInput="onQuery"
      />
      <button class="btn btn-small" onClick="toggleFundStatus"><text>{{fundStatus === 'onsale' ? '在售' : '全部'}}</text></button>
    </view>

    <view class="type-row" a:if="{{types.length > 0}}">
      <view class="type-chip" onTap="onType" data-type=""><text>全部</text></view>
      <view class="type-chip" a:for="{{types}}" a:key="type" onTap="onType" data-type="{{item.type}}">
        <text>{{item.type}} {{item.count}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="fund-row" a:for="{{funds}}" a:key="code">
      <view class="fund-main">
        <text class="fund-name">{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="fund-code">{{item.code}} · {{item.type || '未分类'}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="empty" a:if="{{funds.length === 0}}"><text>本地基金库为空。点上方「同步全量基金」拉取，或在「持仓基金 → ＋ 添加」中搜索添加。</text></view>

    <view class="toolbar" a:if="{{fundPages > 1}}">
      <text class="hint set-hint">第 {{fundPage}} / {{fundPages}} 页 · 共 {{total}} 条</text>
      <button class="btn btn-small" onClick="prevPage" disabled="{{fundPage <= 1}}"><text>上一页</text></button>
      <button class="btn btn-small" onClick="nextPage" disabled="{{fundPage >= fundPages}}"><text>下一页</text></button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 危险操作 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="set-title"><text>⚠️ 危险操作</text></view>
    <button class="btn btn-danger set-clear" onClick="clearEverything"><text>清空全部本地数据</text></button>
  </view>
</view>
